ing-1"><code>pre &gt; string[]</code><a href="#pre--string-1" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to pre--string-1" title="Direct link to pre--string-1" translate="no">​</a></h3>{"\n"}<pre><p>{"1\n2\n3\n"}</p></pre>{"\n"}<h3 class="anchor anchorTargetHideOnScrollNavbar_qJOx" id="pre--element"><code>pre &gt; element</code><a href="#pre--element" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to pre--element" title="Direct link to pre--element" translate="no">​</a></h3>{"\n"}<pre><div class="browserWindow_my1Q"><div class="browserWindowHeader_jXSR"><div class="buttons_uHc7"><span class="dot_giz1" style="background:#f25f58"></span><span class="dot_giz1" style="background:#fbbe3c"></span><span class="dot_giz1" style="background:#58cb42"></span></div><div class="browserWindowAddressBar_Pd8y text--truncate">http:&#47;/localhost:3000</div><div class="browserWindowMenuIcon_Vhuh"><div><span class="bar_rrRL"></span><span class="bar_rrRL"></span><span class="bar_rrRL"></span></div></div></div><div class="browserWindowBody_Idgs">Lol bro</div></div></pre>{"\n"}<h3 class="anchor anchorTargetHideOnScrollNavbar_qJOx" id="pre--element-1"><code>pre &gt; element[]</code><a href="#pre--element-1" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to pre--element-1" title="Direct link to pre--element-1" translate="no">​</a></h3>{"\n"}<pre><a href="/">Front page</a>{"\n"}<p><strong>Input: </strong>{"a = \"abcd\", b = \"cdabcdab\"\n\n"}<strong>Output: </strong>{"3\n\n"}<strong>Explanation: </strong>{"a after three repetitions become \"ab\n"}<strong>cdabcdab</strong>{"cd\", at which time b is a substring.\n"}</p></pre>{"\n"}<h3 class="anchor anchorTargetHideOnScrollNavbar_qJOx" id="pre--code--element"><code>pre &gt; code &gt; element</code><a href="#pre--code--element" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to pre--code--element" title="Direct link to pre--code--element" translate="no">​</a></h3>{"\n"}<pre><code><b>Hey bro</b></code></pre>{"\n"}<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetHideOnScrollNavbar_q